      "paragraph_index": 24,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        24,
        25,
        26
      ],
      "text": "She ran towards the door, pulling free when Mr. White caught her arm. The knocking became louder as she dragged a chair over. She climbed onto it to reach the high door lock. Mr. White searched on his knees, feeling across the floorboards. The door shook with each heavy knock.",
      "text_sha256": "6a27a61a7c402eed86cd47366d430e3bb0f4a28c172feca56347b067e195abb6",
      "word_count": 50,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
