      "text": "The chair scraped, and the last lock began to slide. Just as she reached to open the door, he grabbed the paw and made his third and last wish. Suddenly, the terrible knocking ended. She opened the door, but no one stood outside. Cold wind blew in as her long cry of loss rose into the night. Across the street, the lamp shone on an empty, silent road.",
